 us doing things  more boldly more fully and telling you  know more accurate stories and james  jeter says there are more chapters ahead  and so this is just the beginning ralph  has told so many stories  over the last 54 years but has so many  stories to tell  nice line so many bravos and kudos in  that story bravo to james and dara who  brought it to ralph's attention the fact  that they felt comfortable enough in  challenging him to say you know i'm not  so sure i want to be here and then big  bravos and kudos to ralph lauren who  listened right and said what can we do  about it and then really put out a  really beautiful gorgeous collection  james is 30 years old that's awesome you  know uh and dara is also fairly young  for ralph lauren a guy who's you know in  his 80s to listen to these two young  black employees that didn't have to do  anything and turned it over to them  turned it over to them so the the models  were people of color that's right the  photographers the whole production was  uh people of color and i should point  out i want to thank uh vita and and  jenny cayman our producer and miri  swarms first day back in the office  yesterday for mary she produced that  piece edited that piece really well done  it looked beautiful uh all well  beautifully done vlad yeah thank you
 

